               type="script"
               releaseDate="20261117">
         <title>
            AstroMD Social Export version 1.5.1
         </title>
         <remove>
            src/scripts/AstroMD
            doc/scripts/AstroMD
         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
               This package installs version 1.5.1 of AstroMD Social Export.
               After installation the script appears under
               Script &gt; Astrophotography MD &gt; Social Export.
            </p>
            <p>
               The free version exports Instagram files with a small credit.
               A license key unlocks every platform, custom presets, your own
               watermark, exporting several open images, and carousel export.
            </p>
